# OAEF agent skill mirrors
# The canonical agent skill catalog lives in .agents/skills/ (versioned once).
# .claude/skills/, .cursor/rules/, .windsurf/skills/, .cline/skills/ and .grok/agents/ are generated
# mirrors. They are created as relative symlinks, in which case nothing needs to be ignored here.
# When a filesystem does not support symlinks the installer copies them instead; uncomment the lines
# below in that case so only .agents/skills/ stays versioned:
# .claude/skills/
# .cursor/rules/
# .windsurf/skills/
# .cline/skills/
# .grok/agents/
